            <h1 class="pixel">PRIVACY</h1>
            <p>This site uses Google Analytics to count visits and see which pages people read. Google Analytics sets cookies to do that. There are no ads, no other trackers, and nothing is sold.</p>
            <p>There are no accounts, forms or comments here, so the site doesn't collect anything else about you. Blocking analytics with a browser extension won't break anything.</p>
